{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#card-zh","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Herald 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的任务通知插件，会监听审批请求、等待回复以及子 agent、工作流和后台任务结束事件，并通过宿主服务同步到页面。它在侧边栏加入通知铃铛和历史面板，提供页内浮层与提示音、浏览器系统横幅、宿主直接发送的系统通知三种可切换通道。用户可以查看记录、标记已读、清空历史、调整外观和音量，并诊断通知状态。适合希望及时获知 DSH 后台进展或审批事项的网页用户；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥，宿主通知开关也可由环境变量控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-300","lib/client.js:1394-1407","lib/settings.js:38-45"]}
{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#card-en","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Herald alerts DSH web users about approvals, awaited replies, and finished background work. Its sidebar bell opens a history panel, with in-page toasts, browser banners, or host-sent OS notifications. Users can mark alerts read, clear history, and adjust channels. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-300","lib/client.js:1394-1407","lib/settings.js:38-45"]}
