{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#feature-1","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Herald 的功能「审批与回复提醒」：收到审批请求或 agent 等待回复时创建通知记录。事件自动触发，并带上会话标题或相关说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-259"]}
{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#feature-2","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Herald 的功能「后台任务通知」：子 agent、工作流或后台 job 结束时生成带状态的通知，页面可查看，宿主也可发送系统提示。事件结束时自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:261-300"]}
{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#feature-3","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Herald 的功能「通知历史面板」：点击侧栏铃铛可查看通知、未读状态和时间，并可标记已读或清除记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1394-1407","lib/index.js:340-363"]}
{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#feature-4","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Herald 的功能「独立通知通道」：在面板分别控制页内提醒、浏览器横幅和宿主系统通知；每个通道可单独测试，系统通知可由主机直接发出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:365-395","lib/client.js:1394-1407"]}
{"unit_id":"bululuburuarua666__dsh-herald#feature-5","repo":"bululuburuarua666/dsh-herald","commit":"f0ee0a8fec2c0ccf9975fe578dfc4ec360319973","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Herald 的功能「持久化通知记录」：宿主把最多 300 条记录写入 profile 数据目录，支持跨重启保留；存储不可用时仍以内存记录继续运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-14","lib/index.js:54-122","lib/store.js:20-40"]}
